    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to the market, No. 24 Orlagh Downs offers generous accommodation in a prime location, presenting a fantastic opportunity for a wide range of purchasers seeking a home in the heart of Knocklyon.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 140m² and set in a well sought-after development of similar homes, the property comprises, downstairs, an entrance hall, guest WC, living room, kitchen/dining room and sunroom. Upstairs offers four bedrooms, with the primary bedroom benefiting from an en-suite, along with a main bathroom. The fully converted attic is accessed via its own proper staircase and has its own door, offering a wide variety of possible uses.\r\n\r\nOutside, a side gate leads to the low-maintenance rear garden, while ample parking is provided to the front of the property. The property has a BER of C.\r\n\r\nIdeally located, the property is just a short walk from Supervalu, Knocklyon, as well as local shops at the entrance to the estate. Junction 12 of the M50 is a short distance away, providing excellent access to all major routes and convenient links to the city centre. Excellent primary and secondary schools are within walking distance, including St. Colmcille's (junior and senior), Sancta Maria College and Coláiste Éanna, along with a range of childcare facilities. Knocklyon Shopping Centre, Rathfarnham Shopping Centre and Dundrum Town Centre offer an abundance of retail and dining options, while St. Enda's Park, Marlay Park and the Dublin Mountains provide excellent recreational and sporting amenities close by.\r\n\r\nA mature development, ideally positioned just minutes from a host of local amenities."
      },
